/-!
# Elementary parabolic residuals of PSL₃(4) central covers

This family proves involution and elementary-subgroup lifting, the trivial
Frattini subgroup of each original parabolic residual's two-core, and its
faithful natural module. All maps retain the original central quotient.

These are the I.2.2(3b) local module inputs used in 2.5.7, pp.554--555.
The separate global assertion about lifting a graph-field automorphism is
not asserted by this interface.
-/
